@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@correlationId = corr-health-local-001

### ============================================================================
### 1. Liveness Probe (Processo vivo — não exige autenticação)
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

### ============================================================================
### 2. Readiness Probe (Valida conectividade real com PostgreSQL + MiniStack SQS)
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

### ============================================================================
### 3. Snapshot de Métricas Operacionais e Latência (p50, p95, p99)
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

